      "en": "having become as much better than the angels as the more excellent name he has inherited is better than theirs.",
      "ko": "저가 천사보다 얼마큼 뛰어남은 저희보다 더욱 아름다운 이름을 기업으로 얻으심이니",
      "source_text_hash": "a4e800f72c30eea46bb633c5d41198f351a6640754ffadbea40d64809e4c4bf4",
      "translation_text_hash": "1ef3001987edcfbb95e235f96bb3e4f59cc48e4776bea33e45a6755fad09499a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저가 천사보다 얼마큼 뛰어남은 저희보다 더욱 아름다운 이름을 기업으로 얻으심이니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1ef3001987edcfbb95e235f96bb3e4f59cc48e4776bea33e45a6755fad09499a"
