      "en": "They will perish, but you continue. They all will grow old like a garment does.",
      "ko": "그것들은 멸망할 것이나 오직 주는 영존할 것이요 그것들은 다 옷과 같이 낡아지리니",
      "source_text_hash": "a2989e4a61e9a8007113209e9a8e8cdcbb578d51c13f97d315821adca6ff3626",
      "translation_text_hash": "9c5ac083c62b6f8d9c0cb89c37f5e3e0137e3c7e8bc0e0a8b7db92f2e5cc5926",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
